SUMMARY:Fuego Bachata Sensual Mondays
DESCRIPTION:Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA\n🚨🔥 **FUEGO BACHATA SENSUA
 L MONDAYS — SPECIAL LOCATION THIS MONDAY ONLY!** 🔥🚨\n💃🕺 **NE
 W VENUE. SAME FUEGO. LET’S TURN UP THE HEAT!** ❤️‍🔥\nWe're brin
 ging the Bachata heat to a NEW location this Monday\, October 26th! 🔥 J
 oin us for an unforgettable night of sensual Bachata\, great music\, and a
 mazing connections!\n✨ **9:00 PM — BACHATA SENSUAL LESSON**\nWith the 
 fantastic **Francisco & Ana!** 💃🕺🔥\n🎧 **10:00 PM–1:00 AM —
  SOCIAL DANCING**\nWith **DJ Geronimo** bringing you the Bachata vibes all
  night long! 🎶❤️‍🔥\n📍 **SPECIAL LOCATION THIS MONDAY ONLY!*
 *\n🏢 **StarDance Studio**\n4750 Yonge St.\, Unit 326 — 3rd Floor\n
 🚇 **Sheppard TTC Subway Station**\n💰 **$10 Cover**\n🚨 **IMPORTANT
 : WE ARE NOT AT TEHRANTO THIS MONDAY!**\nMake sure you head to StarDance S
 tudio for this special edition of Fuego!\n❤️‍🔥 **LET’S BRING TH
 E FUEGO BACK TO THE DANCE FLOOR!**\nHave you been meaning to get back out 
 dancing? This is your sign! Come reconnect with your Bachata friends\, mee
 t new dancers\, support our instructors and DJ\, and help us fill the floo
 r with the energy that makes Fuego special. 🔥\n🙌 **Bring your dance 
 partner. Invite your friends. Spread the word!** Every dancer makes a diff
 erence\, and we'd love to see our Fuego family together again!\n🔥 Great
  instructors. Great music. Great people. One HOT Monday night!\n**NEW LOCA
 TION. SAME PASSION. ALL FUEGO!** ❤️‍🔥💃🕺\n#FuegoLatino #Toro
 ntoBachata #BachataSensual
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/salsa-bachata-kizomba-gta/events/3168
 77146/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261007T013523Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T013523Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
